/-!
# True values of the high-resolution family pipeline of the guiding-centre torus

The value `XHE2 c i` of each variable of the high-resolution family ball pipeline at the parameter
`w = c`: for the variables shared with the low-resolution pipeline, the low-resolution values
`XLM c u z (lmapHE2 i)` at the family torus `(u, z) = (xHE2 c 4, xHE2 c 5)`; for the others, the
transport inputs `2^96 𝓛u`, the derivatives, the embedded low-resolution torus and the node data.
The identity of every node (`relHE2_*`) is the identity of the low-resolution node with renamed
variables (`rel_rename`). Generated by `scripts/gc_kam/ew_emit_lean.py`.

Energy-window node 2: gyro-length `ρ_2 = 1/256 − 5 · 2⁻³⁶`, its own family torus `K_2(λ)`; the
fields at `ρ_2` are the nodes `DtJ`, `nRtJ`, `nZtJ`.
-/

@[expose] public section
noncomputable section

set_option linter.style.longLine false

namespace PlasmaLean.Design.RationalStellaratorGC

open PlasmaLean.Theory.KAM PlasmaLean.Design.KamNewton PlasmaLean.Certificates.KronExpr
  PlasmaLean.Certificates.KronBall PlasmaLean.Certificates.KronBallCheb WEll1Z2 Complex PolyExpr

